WEBVTT

00:03.381 --> 00:04.691
Checking landing area.

00:04.691 --> 00:07.001
Have everyone disembark! Hurry!

00:07.911 --> 00:09.151
We're saved.

00:09.151 --> 00:11.011
We'll be safe here.

00:11.271 --> 00:14.311
Everyone's off the ship. 
We're heading back to the battlefield.

00:14.311 --> 00:15.471
Leon's Dad.

00:15.471 --> 00:17.011
We'll go with you.

00:17.391 --> 00:22.011
You're hurt. Students 
should stay evacuated.

00:22.011 --> 00:23.391
B-But...

00:23.391 --> 00:25.481
It's all right, boys.

00:25.771 --> 00:28.721
You've already proven your courage.

00:28.721 --> 00:30.361
Ladies...

00:30.361 --> 00:33.321
Leon will be fine.

00:33.321 --> 00:35.211
Trust him.

00:36.691 --> 00:37.881
Trust him?

00:38.601 --> 00:39.941
Trust Leon?

00:41.371 --> 00:43.291
Wait, wait, wait.

00:43.291 --> 00:44.941
There's no way.

00:54.631 --> 00:56.931
A-At this rate, we'll be wiped out!

01:08.181 --> 01:11.711
Merging with that odd vehicle 
didn't do much to help you!

01:17.281 --> 01:21.701
Villains of the kingdom, 
I'll kill you all!

01:21.921 --> 01:24.281
He's lost his mind.

01:24.281 --> 01:26.711
The magical item has completely 
taken over his body.

01:26.711 --> 01:27.951
Damn it.

01:27.951 --> 01:32.091
Are you that desperate to 
keep fighting, old man?!

01:44.641 --> 01:45.641
<b>Trapped in</b>

01:48.351 --> 01:49.891
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

01:57.881 --> 02:02.121
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>

02:02.121 --> 02:06.721
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim 2</b>

03:09.701 --> 03:12.981
There's a way to stop that monster.

03:10.021 --> 03:13.981
I Don't Care About That!

03:14.251 --> 03:17.301
Really, Marie? I mean, Lady Marie?

03:17.301 --> 03:18.211
Yeah.

03:19.231 --> 03:23.991
<i>I only watched that cutscene from 
my brother's save file, but...</i>

03:24.421 --> 03:28.201
That monster is being summoned 
by an item called a magic flute.

03:28.201 --> 03:33.751
She's right. I witnessed monsters 
being summoned on our school trip.

03:34.111 --> 03:35.571
A magic flute?

03:36.161 --> 03:39.311
That ship is the source 
of the flute's sound.

03:41.171 --> 03:45.141
Let's go. We have to end this suffering.

03:45.471 --> 03:48.641
Okay. Head to the owner 
of the magic flute!

03:48.871 --> 03:52.911
What? Who do you think you are? 
Don't tell us what to do.

03:52.911 --> 03:55.271
<i>You haven't figured it out yet?!</i>

03:55.601 --> 03:57.711
Kyle, just do it.

03:57.711 --> 04:01.621
Honestly, you never change, mistress.

04:04.501 --> 04:06.871
What's wrong? Is that all you've got?

04:06.871 --> 04:08.781
Shut up, fallen warrior!

04:12.561 --> 04:13.621
Watch out!

04:13.621 --> 04:15.011
Damn it!

04:24.751 --> 04:26.781
I can't, I can't, I can't!

04:25.551 --> 04:28.381
What an unladylike voice.

04:28.381 --> 04:30.461
It's all right, though.

04:30.461 --> 04:31.641
Eare?

04:32.111 --> 04:37.151
Is that what you're calling 
me? How congenial.

04:37.521 --> 04:40.241
In any case, there's 
nothing to worry about.

04:40.241 --> 04:43.151
That sourpuss will escort us.

04:44.041 --> 04:45.651
Energy fully charged.

04:46.071 --> 04:48.411
Firing boson particle cannon.

04:59.261 --> 05:01.521
Wh-What was that light?

05:01.521 --> 05:03.421
I've never seen such magic before.

05:04.781 --> 05:09.431
Yes, it's magic.
Incredibly powerful magic.

05:09.781 --> 05:12.411
N-No, that's...

05:12.881 --> 05:15.061
The demon lord's wrath!

05:18.431 --> 05:21.871
Now, before that monster regenerates!

05:21.871 --> 05:24.071
Yes, I know.

05:28.381 --> 05:30.501
We'll be their backup!

05:30.501 --> 05:32.031
Don't tell us what to do!

05:38.581 --> 05:40.381
There it is! The magic flute!

05:40.751 --> 05:41.651
That's...

05:42.351 --> 05:43.601
Hertrude!

05:44.171 --> 05:45.891
How did you get here?

05:45.891 --> 05:48.181
No, wait. Did you play the flute?

05:49.691 --> 05:52.181
I'll destroy them all.

05:52.761 --> 05:56.741
Please stop. At this rate, 
everyone will die.

05:58.031 --> 05:58.931
So?

05:59.711 --> 06:04.571
So the people of the 
principality will die, too!

06:04.571 --> 06:06.191
Let's put an end to this!

06:06.571 --> 06:07.421
No.

06:08.671 --> 06:09.911
Never.

06:09.911 --> 06:10.841
You...

06:10.841 --> 06:13.491
If you want to kill me, then kill me!

06:13.781 --> 06:16.721
That won't stop the guardian of the land!

06:16.721 --> 06:18.751
It'll keep reviving!

06:21.131 --> 06:25.911
I understand that you hate us, but 
what's the point in continuing to fight?

06:25.911 --> 06:28.591
Won't it just cause more pointless deaths?

06:28.591 --> 06:30.061
Oh, shut up.

06:30.061 --> 06:34.601
The principality can trace its 
roots back to the Holfort royals.

06:36.191 --> 06:40.601
The principality? I don't care 
what happens to it anymore.

06:40.971 --> 06:41.741
What?

06:42.231 --> 06:43.241
What did you say?

06:44.081 --> 06:45.061
I don't care

06:45.671 --> 06:51.491
what happens to the principality 
that exploited me and my sister.

06:52.911 --> 06:58.061
We didn't know they killed our 
parents, and we let them use us.

07:00.041 --> 07:05.131
Everything I loved has been taken 
from me, even my sister Rauda!

07:05.561 --> 07:07.531
I don't trust anyone anymore.

07:07.531 --> 07:10.331
They should all just go away!

07:10.331 --> 07:14.641
I want nothing more than to 
destroy this hopeless world!

07:14.641 --> 07:18.261
I want to avenge my sister and parents!

07:18.641 --> 07:21.811
Isn't that right? Why?

07:22.241 --> 07:26.651
Why couldn't we be happy? Why?!

07:27.191 --> 07:30.401
S-Still, this is wrong.

07:30.811 --> 07:32.861
What good is revenge?

07:32.861 --> 07:36.041
That's not what your sister wants!

07:36.041 --> 07:37.161
Shut up!

07:37.411 --> 07:40.291
Shut your mouth, dreamer!

07:40.291 --> 07:42.011
Ms. Marie?

07:42.011 --> 07:45.711
Wh-What are you saying? 
Whose side are you on?

07:45.711 --> 07:48.901
I don't know, and I don't care!

07:48.901 --> 07:51.341
That's just a bunch of 
idealistic nonsense!

07:51.341 --> 07:56.351
Revenge is wrong? Whatever! 
Who do you think you are?

07:56.701 --> 07:59.781
Her sister wouldn't want that?

07:59.781 --> 08:03.561
You've got some nerve 
speaking on her behalf!

08:03.561 --> 08:04.851
B-But...

08:04.851 --> 08:08.431
So she's supposed to accept her 
misery and not seek revenge?

08:08.431 --> 08:10.611
Does she not have the right to be happy?

08:10.611 --> 08:13.311
What about her feelings?!

08:14.991 --> 08:16.981
You have no problem lecturing her,

08:16.981 --> 08:20.471
but if you lost your loved ones, 
would you take it lying down?

08:20.471 --> 08:23.301
You wouldn't avenge them 
even if it's wrong?

08:23.301 --> 08:25.001
I-I...

08:25.411 --> 08:28.011
Have you ever experienced 
unbearable regret?

08:28.011 --> 08:30.221
Has anyone you loved ever died?

08:30.221 --> 08:32.011
You never get to see them again!

08:33.061 --> 08:38.761
It hurts when people you 
love die. It really hurts!

08:39.081 --> 08:43.641
W-Wait. Right now, stopping 
that monster is our priority.

08:43.641 --> 08:45.101
Shut up!

08:45.321 --> 08:49.151
If this is all it takes to destroy 
this world, then I say let it happen!

08:49.521 --> 08:54.541
I know it's wrong and that we 
shouldn't let it happen, but...

08:54.541 --> 08:58.301
but we still can't stop it!

09:41.741 --> 09:48.791
I never thought the Saint who only 
cares about money would defend me.

09:50.061 --> 09:51.691
I'm not defending you.

09:51.691 --> 09:56.411
I just can't stand those two and 
their main character syndrome.

09:59.151 --> 10:03.061
I never would have felt 
like this if not for you.

10:03.951 --> 10:07.141
Are you really okay with this, though?

10:07.451 --> 10:08.821
No.

10:10.081 --> 10:11.611
Not at all.

10:13.301 --> 10:14.191
But...

10:19.471 --> 10:23.121
Hurry. Get away from me.

10:24.521 --> 10:25.651
What's wrong?

10:25.651 --> 10:30.271
The cost of summoning guardians 
with this flute is the user's life.

10:30.601 --> 10:32.551
Now that I've broken the contract,

10:33.451 --> 10:38.711
I'll never be able to play it again, 
and the guardian will try to kill me.

10:39.131 --> 10:40.351
What?

10:40.851 --> 10:42.011
B-But...

10:42.531 --> 10:46.431
And the principality will surrender.

10:54.441 --> 10:56.151
Get away, everyone!

11:00.491 --> 11:01.801
Livia, are you all right?

11:01.801 --> 11:02.811
Vandel!

11:03.521 --> 11:04.661
What's going on?

11:05.031 --> 11:07.041
What are they doing here?

11:09.151 --> 11:11.141
Ms. Hertrude's here, too?

11:17.141 --> 11:19.241
Vandel, enough!

11:19.241 --> 11:22.301
Fanoss has declared the fighting over!

11:23.001 --> 11:26.811
Princess, do not worry.

11:26.811 --> 11:29.441
I'll kill that villain this instant.

11:31.851 --> 11:35.811
I shall obliterate the kingdom's forces.

11:35.811 --> 11:39.571
No! It's over, Vandel!

11:41.791 --> 11:43.501
Princess...

11:53.611 --> 11:57.761
Father, Mother...

11:54.361 --> 11:58.591
Are you sure this was the right choice?

11:59.021 --> 12:03.821
Both the people and nobility 
wish to fight the kingdom,

12:03.821 --> 12:08.491
which is why the king and 
queen had to go away.

12:09.131 --> 12:11.671
There's no point in crying over it now.

12:11.671 --> 12:15.071
You'll get to avenge your family.

12:15.471 --> 12:19.471
If you're a knight of the principality, 
forget your meaningless regrets.

12:29.371 --> 12:30.321
Princess.

12:35.181 --> 12:36.271
Vandel...

12:38.001 --> 12:46.611
Do not worry. I shall fight for you and 
your sister in your parents' place.

12:48.451 --> 12:50.641
Vandel...

12:52.861 --> 12:54.791
I swear on this sword...

12:58.791 --> 13:00.651
This cannot end.

13:00.921 --> 13:04.151
This cannot be the end!

13:04.441 --> 13:05.431
Vandel...

13:06.661 --> 13:10.211
I will keep fighting after my death.

13:10.211 --> 13:13.611
That is all I can do to atone.

13:13.611 --> 13:15.711
That is my...

13:18.171 --> 13:21.671
code of chivalry!

13:29.111 --> 13:32.431
You bastard!

13:52.301 --> 13:54.221
Damn it!

13:58.771 --> 13:59.931
Luxion!

14:00.901 --> 14:02.981
Damn you!

14:05.091 --> 14:07.811
Sorry, old man.

14:10.841 --> 14:12.071
Impact.

14:26.101 --> 14:27.191
Vandel!

14:42.551 --> 14:47.211
Vandel! Vandel! Vandel!

14:47.211 --> 14:48.501
Vandel!

14:49.451 --> 14:52.031
P-Princess...

14:52.701 --> 14:56.721
This is the end for me.

14:57.101 --> 15:00.351
Please don't leave me.

15:01.551 --> 15:04.011
Princess...

15:04.011 --> 15:05.731
Hey, you!

15:06.001 --> 15:07.731
Don't die yet!

15:08.011 --> 15:11.531
What are you saying? 
He's the Black Knight!

15:11.761 --> 15:17.491
I know that! How many times do 
you think he's beaten me? Still...

15:20.501 --> 15:23.501
Are you going to leave her all alone?

15:29.111 --> 15:34.781
<i>There are those in the kingdom 
who care for the princess.</i>

15:35.251 --> 15:37.151
<i>Now I can finally...</i>

15:49.651 --> 15:51.461
<i>I lost.</i>

15:52.951 --> 15:56.051
Princess, please...

15:57.701 --> 15:58.681
Vandel...

16:01.911 --> 16:03.821
Be happy.

16:07.411 --> 16:08.481
Vandel!

16:31.651 --> 16:34.091
Don't waste any time.

16:34.091 --> 16:37.291
If you don't get out of here 
quickly, you'll be killed, too.

16:38.221 --> 16:39.581
But...

16:40.911 --> 16:42.951
Come on, you two.

16:42.951 --> 16:44.771
Hurry, please.

16:51.071 --> 16:52.431
End this.

17:08.221 --> 17:11.731
Leon Fou Bartfort...

17:12.001 --> 17:14.671
Now, what should I do?

17:14.671 --> 17:18.991
Not much can be done against an 
endlessly regenerating enemy.

17:19.241 --> 17:21.931
Olivia is severely weakened.

17:21.931 --> 17:22.991
Luxion.

17:23.861 --> 17:24.691
What is it?

17:26.521 --> 17:27.641
Understood.

17:28.501 --> 17:32.501
The main ship is out of range, 
so I'll gather energy in the Arroganz.

17:32.961 --> 17:35.011
Out of range? For what?

17:39.111 --> 17:40.901
Olivia's power.

17:42.161 --> 17:43.521
Mr. Leon...

17:44.771 --> 17:46.741
Livia... Angie...

17:47.851 --> 17:50.581
I'll add Olivia's wavelength 
to your attack.

17:56.251 --> 17:59.091
It's time to go big or go home.

18:07.921 --> 18:09.371
Don't let them get close!

18:09.371 --> 18:11.101
Don't tell us what to do!

18:26.961 --> 18:28.031
Fabulous.

19:06.591 --> 19:09.351
He saved me?

19:10.841 --> 19:12.131
He defeated it!

19:12.131 --> 19:13.301
Yes!

19:15.261 --> 19:18.131
We finally defeated the final boss.

19:18.131 --> 19:21.071
Arroganz has reached its limit, though.

19:26.251 --> 19:27.291
Leon!

19:30.951 --> 19:32.161
Oh, my.

19:47.881 --> 19:51.561
Hey, did I do the right thing?

19:53.351 --> 19:58.491
I said I wanted to live a 
peaceful life as an NPC,

19:59.671 --> 20:01.881
but tons of people ended up dying.

20:02.571 --> 20:04.271
I killed a ton of people, too.

20:05.651 --> 20:10.911
If I were the protagonist of a story, 
I could've done a better job.

20:12.911 --> 20:15.231
You're overestimating your own importance.

20:15.231 --> 20:20.921
The war would've happened either way, 
and nobody expected much from you.

20:24.011 --> 20:25.361
You're a real dick.

20:28.171 --> 20:31.081
So I am just an NPC.

20:32.281 --> 20:35.201
Anyway, I'm surprised we won.

20:35.941 --> 20:40.781
Isn't that because this is the world 
of your so-called "otome game"?

20:41.721 --> 20:44.091
Huh? What do you mean?

20:44.981 --> 20:48.571
You're always complaining about 
it while hurling obscenities.

20:49.251 --> 20:52.531
How "love will save the world."

21:09.071 --> 21:10.241
Leon!

21:10.241 --> 21:11.841
Mr. Leon!

21:12.541 --> 21:14.811
Angie, Livia.

21:16.921 --> 21:21.361
You may be an NPC, but their love is real.

21:21.971 --> 21:25.141
The truth is that love ended the fighting.

21:26.301 --> 21:29.821
Isn't it about time you 
made your decision?

21:30.811 --> 21:33.491
You love them, don't you?

21:34.781 --> 21:36.751
You don't get it.

21:37.921 --> 21:42.191
I want to take good care of 
them <i>because</i> I love them.

21:44.601 --> 21:49.231
<i>I hadn't thought about what 
I'd say, but for now...</i>

21:52.031 --> 21:53.301
I'm back.

23:26.271 --> 23:29.551
The fighting's over, peace has been 
restored, and my brother's engaged?

23:29.551 --> 23:30.281
Master.

23:30.281 --> 23:32.611
Leon's screams echo across 
an inescapable future!

23:32.841 --> 23:33.781
Master?

23:33.781 --> 23:36.301
The final episode, 
"This World Is Tough for Mobs."

23:36.621 --> 23:39.951
The final boss of life is romantic events!
